  FX: Assets/Resources/images/dark/a16_darkInfoFXElectricWhite.png
  Title: 'Zoo Update! '
  Details: Welcome to the BitLife Zoo Update!
  BulletPointEmoji:
  BulletPoints:
  - '<color=#BAFF79>Acquire a dilapidated zoo from the government and rehabilitate it into the best zoo your country has ever seen!</color>\n\n<align="center">What to do in this update:      <color=#000000>.</color></align>'
  - '<color=#BAFF79>Check on your animals</color> and <color=#BAFF79>improve</color> the living conditions in <color=#BAFF79>their habitats</color>!'
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_Habitats
  - \n<color=#BAFF79>Find new animals</color> and new homes for old ones <color=#BAFF79>on the Trading Post</color>!
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_TradingPost
  - \n<color=#BAFF79>Manage your zoo's admission fees</color>!
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_AdmissionFee
  - \n<color=#BAFF79>Add new attractions to your zoo</color> to make it more profitable and appealing!
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_Attractions
  - \n<color=#BAFF79>Hire competent employees to take care of your animals</color>!
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_EmployeesAndHire
  - \n<color=#BAFF79>Invest funds</color> into your zoo's bank account <color=#BAFF79>to keep it afloat</color>!
  - //:image:a16_darkListItem_Invest
  - '<color=#BAFF79><align="center">AND SO MUCH MORE!      <color=#000000>.</color></align>'
  WrappedVideo: 0
